cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software (Zenodo DOI below) and the accompanying manuscript when it is published."
type: software
title: "GFEX-EEG: Geodesic Fiducial Extrapolation for MRI-free EEG Source Imaging"
abstract: >-
  A hardware-agnostic geodesic-extrapolation engine that recovers the
  Helix-Tragus Junction (HTJ) anatomical landmark from three reliable
  EEG electrodes (Cz, T7, T8), bypassing the LPA/RPA ambiguity and
  zero-depth standardization issues commonly encountered in legacy
  EEG datasets. Ships a deterministic Tier 1 geodesic walk on the
  ICBM152 scalp manifold plus optional Tier 1.5 cohort-specific
  residual-correction MLPs for Polhemus, Neuromag, and CapTrak
  digitization hardware. Black-box wrappers for EEGLAB, FieldTrip,
  Brainstorm, and MNE-Python.
